label "Parallelization fan-out gather diagram"
box in 20 105 80 42 "input"
box b1 170 26 110 38 "branch 1"
box b2 170 107 110 38 "branch 2"
box b3 170 188 110 38 "branch 3"
box agg 330 100 116 52 "aggregate|code or model" acc
arrow in b1
arrow in b2
arrow in b3
arrow b1 agg
arrow b2 agg
arrow b3 agg
note "same shape, two modes: split different work, or run the same work N ways"
